# bgp-srpolicy-1 decoding test - SR-Policy IPv4 NLRI via ze bgp decode
# Tests SR-Policy NLRI (RFC 9830, SAFI 73) with distinguisher=0, color=100, endpoint=10.0.0.1
#
# Wire bytes breakdown (RFC 9830 Section 2.1 wire form, as in MP_REACH_NLRI):
# 60 = NLRI Length, 96 bits (the value AFI 1 requires)
# 00 00 00 00 = distinguisher 0
# 00 00 00 64 = color 100
# 0A 00 00 01 = endpoint 10.0.0.1
stdin=payload:hex=6000000000000000640A000001
cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze bgp decode --json --nlri ipv4/sr-policy -:stdin=payload
expect=json:json={"color":100,"distinguisher":0,"endpoint":"10.0.0.1"}
